xtRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":60},{"endIndex":145,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":145,"startIndex":61,"textRun":{"content":"前回の振り返り(Day 15)で「18スキル、37コミット、星2つ」と書いた。あれから1週間、毎日の発行は止まっていない。3週間を過ぎたので、また正直な数字を並べる。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":61},{"endIndex":146,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":146,"startIndex":145,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":145},{"endIndex":158,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":158,"startIndex":146,"textRun":{"content":"## 起: 今週の数字\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":146},{"endIndex":159,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":159,"startIndex":158,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":158},{"endIndex":256,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":256,"startIndex":159,"textRun":{"content":"2026-09-28時点の実測: スキルは21個、mainへのコミットは52、GitHubの星は3、フォークは2。Qiitaの記事はシリーズ18本(全20本)、いいねの合計は9、ストックは5。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":159},{"endIndex":257,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":257,"startIndex":256,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":256},{"endIndex":347,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":347,"startIndex":257,"textRun":{"content":"前回よりスキルが3つ、コミットが15、星が1つ増えた。正直に言うと、数字はまだ小さい。いいねの合計が2桁に届かない。毎日書いている人間としては、もう少し跳ねてほしい気持ちもある。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":257},{"endIndex":348,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":348,"startIndex":347,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":347},{"endIndex":370,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":370,"startIndex":348,"textRun":{"content":"## 承: でも、数字に出ないことが起きた\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":348},{"endIndex":371,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":371,"startIndex":370,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":370},{"endIndex":555,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":555,"startIndex":371,"textRun":{"content":"今週いちばん大きかったのは、数字の増え方ではない。知らない人からプルリクエストが来たことだ。@mangomac という人が、3本も送ってくれた。READMEの表の途中に挟まっていた段落の修正、避難所スキルのキャッシュが7日以上古いときに警告を出す改善、そして避難所の座標に nan や範囲外の値が混ざったときの除外処理。どれも、僕が気づいていなかった所に効くやつだ。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":371},{"endIndex":556,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":556,"startIndex":555,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":555},{"endIndex":682,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":682,"startIndex":556,"textRun":{"content":"しかも3本とも、lintとCIと回帰テストを通した状態で来た。つまりこの人は、CONTRIBUTINGを読み、テストの書き方に合わせ、CIが通ることを確認してから送っている。僕が「来るかもしれない誰か」のために書いていた整備を、そのまま使ってくれた。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":556},{"endIndex":683,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":683,"startIndex":682,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":682},{"endIndex":705,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":705,"startIndex":683,"textRun":{"content":"## 転: 整備は未来の誰かへの手紙だった\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":683},{"endIndex":706,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":706,"startIndex":705,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":705},{"endIndex":810,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":810,"startIndex":706,"textRun":{"content":"正直に言うと、ドキュメントや CI は毎日の記事書きの中ではいちばん地味な作業だった。実測日ヘッダの統一、URLコントラクト、90日鮮度チェック。書いている間は「これ、誰が得するんだ」と思わなくもなかった。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":706},{"endIndex":811,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":811,"startIndex":810,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":810},{"endIndex":961,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":961,"startIndex":811,"textRun":{"content":"答えは2つあって、ひとつは今週来た誰か。もうひとつは、未来の僕だった。この週の半ば、僕が仕込んだhealth-checkが僕自身のミス(新しいスキル3つをREADMEの表に載せ忘れた)を検出して、issueを立ててきた。自分の仕掛けた網に、自分がかかる。少し間抜けだが、網が働いている証拠でもある。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":811},{"endIndex":962,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":962,"startIndex":961,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":961},{"endIndex":978,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":978,"startIndex":962,"textRun":{"content":"## 結: 残り8日でやること\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":962},{"endIndex":979,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":979,"startIndex":978,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":978},{"endIndex":1132,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1132,"startIndex":979,"textRun":{"content":"30日チャレンジはあと8日。やることは変わらない。ロードマップに残っている暮らしのテーマを1日1本、実測を取って、スキルと記事を出す。30日で「完成」にはならなくて、そこからは保守の日々が始まる。公開データは生き物なので、URLは死に、CSVの形式は変わる。実測日とCIがあるのは、その日々を回すためだ。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":979},{"endIndex":1133,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1133,"startIndex":1132,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":1132},{"endIndex":1145,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1145,"startIndex":1133,"textRun":{"content":"今日の持ち帰りは3つ。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":1133},{"endIndex":1146,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1146,"startIndex":1145,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":1145},{"endIndex":1209,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1209,"startIndex":1146,"textRun":{"content":"1. **数字は小さいままでいい。** 先に伸びるのは数字以外のこと——書く癖、整備の精度、そして誰かとの接点——のほうだ。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":1146},{"endIndex":1274,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1274,"startIndex":1209,"textRun":{"content":"2. **READMEとCIは、未来の誰かへの手紙。** 誰かは実際に来る。来たときに迷わせない整備は、書いた分だけ返ってくる。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":1209},{"endIndex":1335,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1335,"startIndex":1274,"textRun":{"content":"3. **自分のCIは自分を捕まえる。** それでいい。網が働くということは、誰かが迷子になる前に気づけるということだ。\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":1274},{"endIndex":1336,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1336,"startIndex":1335,"textRun":{"content":"\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT","namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"}},"startIndex":1335},{"endIndex":1408,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"endIndex":1408,"startIndex":1336,"textRun":{"content":"kurashi-skillは公開開発中。リポジトリはここ → https://gi